all positive for a numbers if
    for all cases in which
        a number N is in the numbers
        it is the case that
            N > 0.

a numbers has negative if
    a number N is in the numbers
    and N < 0.

the doubled list for a numbers is a list L if
    L is the list of each T such that
        a thing N is in the numbers
        and a thing T = N * 2.

the only positive for a numbers is a list L if
    L is the list of each N such that
        a number N is in the numbers
        and N > 0.

all adults for a people if
    for all cases in which
        a person is in the people
        it is the case that
            the age of the person is a number N
            and N >= 18.

